---
/**
 * MobileErgonomicsSection — Touch Ergonomics & 48dp Bounding Box Rules
 * Validated against WCAG 2.2 AA (Criterion 2.5.8 Target Size).
 */
---

<div class="ergonomics-container" data-platform-target="universal">
  <!-- Section 1: Regla de 48dp y 56dp -->
  <section class="spec-card" id="sec-ergonomia-48dp">
    <div class="card-header-row">
      <div class="card-badge-icon"><i class="pi pi-hand"></i></div>
      <div>
        <span class="card-eyebrow">ERGONOMÍA TÁCTIL · WCAG 2.2 AA</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">1. Regla de Oro: Objetivo Táctil Mínimo 48×48dp (56dp en Campo)</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="card-text">
      Todo control interactivo en pantalla móvil (botones, checkboxes, selectores, iconos y chips) debe tener un <strong>Bounding Box táctil mínimo de 48×48dp</strong>. Para aplicaciones de choferes y bodegueros con guantes de seguridad (Operations Android), los botones críticos de confirmación se expanden a <strong>56dp</strong> de altura.
    </p>

    <!-- Visual Target Comparison -->
    <div class="target-comparison-grid">
      <div class="target-spec-card">
        <div class="target-visual-box target-48">
          <div class="target-bounding-box">
            <span class="bounding-label">48×48dp Bounding Box</span>
            <button type="button" class="spec-btn-demo min-48">
              <i class="pi pi-check"></i>
              <span>Botón Estándar (48dp)</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="target-spec-meta">
          <strong>Uso Estándar (Comprador & Móvil General)</strong>
          <p>Mínimo accesible WCAG 2.2 AA para navegación y formularios con una mano.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="target-spec-card">
        <div class="target-visual-box target-56">
          <div class="target-bounding-box">
            <span class="bounding-label">56×56dp Bounding Box</span>
            <button type="button" class="spec-btn-demo max-56">
              <i class="pi pi-truck"></i>
              <span>Confirmar en Sitio (56dp Guantes)</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="target-spec-meta">
          <strong>Uso Industrial (Choferes & Almacén)</strong>
          <p>Superficie ampliada para evitar falsos toques bajo vibración vehicular o uso de guantes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 2: Zonas de Alcance del Pulgar (Thumb Zone Reachability) -->
  <section class="spec-card" id="sec-zonas-alcance">
    <div class="card-header-row">
      <div class="card-badge-icon"><i class="pi pi-compass"></i></div>
      <div>
        <span class="card-eyebrow">ERGONOMÍA · ALCANCE BIOMECÁNICO</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">2. Zonas de Alcance del Pulgar (Thumb Zones)</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="card-text">
      En pantallas de 6.1" a 6.7" (360dp a 412dp de ancho lógico), la ergonomía de una mano impone colocar las acciones primarias en la zona natural inferior:
    </p>

    <div class="thumb-zone-diagram">
      <div class="zone-row zone-hard">
        <div class="zone-badge red">ZONA DIFÍCIL (Top 25%)</div>
        <div class="zone-content">
          <strong>Top App Bar, Título de Pantalla, Icono de Perfil</strong>
          <p>Ubicación solo para información pasiva o acciones poco frecuentes. Requiere dos manos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-row zone-medium">
        <div class="zone-badge yellow">ZONA ALCANZABLE (Centro 40%)</div>
        <div class="zone-content">
          <strong>Tarjetas de Lista, Formularios y Filtros con Scroll</strong>
          <p>Accesible con leve estiramiento del pulgar. Se desplaza fácilmente mediante scroll gestual.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="zone-row zone-easy">
        <div class="zone-badge green">ZONA NATURAL / ÓPTIMA (Inferior 35%)</div>
        <div class="zone-content">
          <strong>Bottom Navigation, Botón Principal CTA, Escaneo y Modal Sheet</strong>
          <p>Máxima ergonomía y velocidad. No exige mover la palma de la mano ni reajustar el agarre.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .ergonomics-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .spec-card {
    background: var(--nexa-surface-card, #ffffff);
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-structural, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: var(--nexa-radius-card, 16px);
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    scroll-margin-top: 80px;
  }

  .card-header-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .card-badge-icon {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--nexa-color-primary-50, #eff6ff);
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-600, #2a67d9);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 17px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .card-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-700, #1d4ed8);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-display, sans-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Target Comparison Grid */
  .target-comparison-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .target-comparison-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .target-spec-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-default, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--nexa-color-neutral-50, #f8fafc);
  }

  .target-visual-box {
    padding: 24px 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-default, #e2e8f0);
  }

  .target-bounding-box {
    border: 1.5px dashed #2a67d9;
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: rgba(42, 103, 217, 0.04);
  }

  .bounding-label {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2a67d9;
  }

  .spec-btn-demo {
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--nexa-color-primary-600, #2a67d9);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(42, 103, 217, 0.25);
    transition: all 0.15s ease;

    &:hover {
      background: #1d4ed8;
    }

    &.min-48 {
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 0 18px;
    }

    &.max-56 {
      min-height: 56px;
      padding: 0 22px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      background: #082846;
      border: 1px solid #1a4975;

      &:hover {
        background: #0d3860;
      }
    }
  }

  .target-spec-meta {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;

    strong {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
    }

    p {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin: 0;
    }
  }

  /* Thumb Zone Diagram */
  .thumb-zone-diagram {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .zone-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-default, #e2e8f0);

    &.zone-hard {
      background: #fef2f2;
      border-color: #fecaca;
    }

    &.zone-medium {
      background: #fffbeb;
      border-color: #fde68a;
    }

    &.zone-easy {
      background: #f0fdf4;
      border-color: #bbf7d0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .zone-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 6px;
    }
  }

  .zone-badge {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;

    &.red {
      background: #dc2626;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    &.yellow {
      background: #d97706;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    &.green {
      background: #16a34a;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
  }

  .zone-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;

    strong {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
    }

    p {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
